{"strongs": "H7167", "word": "קָרַע", "translit": "qa.ra", "root": "קרע", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "tear", "definition": "קָרַע 63 verb tear (Late Hebrew id. ; Arabic strike head, bell, etc., beat drum, box ear, gnash teeth ( Frey Dozy ); also impugn, censure ); — Qal Perfect 3 masculine singular ׳ ק 1Sam 15:28 +, etc.; Imperfect 3 masculine singular זַיִּקְרַע Gen 37:29 +; 1 singular suffix אֶקְרָעֶנָּה 1Kgs 11:12 , etc.; Imperative masculine plural קִרְעוּ 2Sam 3:31 ; Joel 2:13 Infinitive absolute קָרֹעַ 1Kgs 11:11 construct לִקְרוֺעַ Eccl 3:7 , suffix קָרְעִי Ezra 9:5 Participle active קֹרֵעַ 1Kgs 11:31 passive קָרוּעַ 2Sam 15:32 , etc.; — tear, rend: 1. a. usually (39 t.) of rending garment in (I) sign of grief, distress: בֶּגֶד (29 t.) Gen 37:29 ; Gen 37:34 ; Gen 44:13 ; 2Sam 13:19 +; לִשְׁנַיִם קְרָעִים ׳ ב ׳ ק 2Kgs 2:12 , ׳ לְבַבְכֶם וְאַל ב ׳ ק Joel 2:13 participle Pass. ׳ בְּגָדָיו ק 2Sam 1:2 construct ׳ קְרֻעֵי ב torn of garments (pers. with torn garments 2Sam 13:31 (but read ׳ קָֽרְעוּ ב ᵐ5 ᵑ9 Th We and others), 2Kgs 18:37 = Isa 36:22 ; Jer 41:5 מְעִיל Job 1:20 ; Job 2:12 ; Ezra 9:3 (+ בֶּנֶד ), כְּתֹנֶת 2Sam 13:19 , קָרוּעַ כֻּתָּנְתּוֺ 2Sam 15:32 ( Ges «GKC:121d»§ 121d ); שְׂמָתֹ Gen 37:34 ; Gen 44:13 ; Josh 7:6 passive participle מַדָּיו קְרֻעִים 1Sam 4:12 (2) as symbolic act, שַׂלְמָה שְׁנֵים עָשָׁר ׳ קְרָעִים ק 1Kgs 11:30 (3) absolute עֵת לִקְרוֺעַ וְעֵת לִתְפּוֺר Eccl 3:7 . \\ \\ b. tear away or out: veils Ezek 13:21 , fillets from ( מֵעַל ) arms v Ezek 13:20 , mark of leprosy out of ( מִן ) garment Lev 13:56 . 2. tear away sovereignty (under figure of garment), subject ׳ י , מֵעַל person 1Sam 15:28 ; 1Kgs 11:11 , also מִיַּד 1Sam 28:17 ; 1Kgs 11:12 ; 1Kgs 11:31 , מִן 1Kgs 14:8 , absolute 1Kgs 11:13 with accusative ׳ יִשׂ + מֵעַל 2Kgs 17:21 . 3. tear, rend asunder: \\ \\ a. book with ( ב ) knife Jer 36:23 . \\ \\ b. = make wide, large , eyes, with ( ב ) stibium Jer 4:30 windows, לוֺ ׳ וק [ ו ] חַלּוֺנָ֑י Jer 22:14 . \\ \\ c. rend open heavens, and descend of ׳ י , Isa 63:19 . 4. tear, rend , of wild beasts: ׳ י as fierce bear Hos 13:8 (object סְגוֺר לִבָּם ); figurative of human foes Ps 35:15 (accusative of person omitted), so Hup and others, but (from context) Ol Bae We and others malign, rail (compare Arabic above); > Gr and others קָרְאוֺ . Niph`al be rent , of garment ( מְעִיל ), Imperfect 3 masculine singular וַיִּקָּרַ֑ע 1Sam 15:27 , יִקָּרֵעַ Exod 28:32 ; Exod 39:23 be rent, split asunder , of altar 1Kgs 13:3 ; 1Kgs 13:5 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7605')\">BDB7605</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7167')\">H7167</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7604')\">BDB7604</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7606')\">BDB7606</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>קָרַע</bdbheb><sub>63</sub> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>tear</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; Arabic <placeholder4872/> <highlight>strike</highlight> head, bell, etc., <highlight>beat</highlight> drum, <highlight>box</highlight> ear, <highlight>gnash</highlight> teeth (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Frey')\">Frey</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dozy')\">Dozy</lookup>); also <highlight>impugn, censure</highlight>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 15:28\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(9,15,28)\">1Sam 15:28</ref> +, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>זַיִּקְרַע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 37:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,37,29)\">Gen 37:29</ref> +; 1 singular suffix <bdbheb>אֶקְרָעֶנָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:12\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,12)\">1Kgs 11:12</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> masculine plural <bdbheb>קִרְעוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 3:31\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(10,3,31)\">2Sam 3:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Joel 2:13\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(29,2,13)\">Joel 2:13</ref> <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>קָרֹעַ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:11\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,11)\">1Kgs 11:11</ref> construct <bdbheb>לִקְרוֺעַ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 3:7\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(21,3,7)\">Eccl 3:7</ref>, suffix <bdbheb>קָרְעִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 9:5\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(15,9,5)\">Ezra 9:5</ref> <highlight>Participle active</highlight> <bdbheb>קֹרֵעַ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:31\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,31)\">1Kgs 11:31</ref> <highlight>passive</highlight> <bdbheb>קָרוּעַ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:32\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,32)\">2Sam 15:32</ref>, etc.; — <highlight>tear, rend:</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1. a.</b> usually (39 t.) of <highlight>rending</highlight> garment in (I) sign of grief, distress: <bdbheb>בֶּגֶד</bdbheb> (29 t.) <ref ref=\"Gen 37:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,37,29)\">Gen 37:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 37:34\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(1,37,34)\">Gen 37:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 44:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,44,13)\">Gen 44:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 13:19\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(10,13,19)\">2Sam 13:19</ref> +; <bdbheb>לִשְׁנַיִם קְרָעִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ב</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:12\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,12)\">2Kgs 2:12</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְבַבְכֶם וְאַל ב</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Joel 2:13\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(29,2,13)\">Joel 2:13</ref> participle Pass. <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּגָדָיו ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 1:2\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(10,1,2)\">2Sam 1:2</ref> construct <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>קְרֻעֵי ב</bdbheb> <highlight>torn of garments</highlight> (pers. <highlight>with torn garments</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Sam 13:31\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(10,13,31)\">2Sam 13:31</ref> (but read <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>קָֽרְעוּ ב</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ9</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('The')\">Th</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> and others), <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:37\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,37)\">2Kgs 18:37</ref> = <ref ref=\"Isa 36:22\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(23,36,22)\">Isa 36:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 41:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,41,5)\">Jer 41:5</ref> <bdbheb>מְעִיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 1:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,1,20)\">Job 1:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 2:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,2,12)\">Job 2:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 9:3\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(15,9,3)\">Ezra 9:3</ref> (+ <bdbheb>בֶּנֶד</bdbheb>), <bdbheb>כְּתֹנֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 13:19\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(10,13,19)\">2Sam 13:19</ref>, <bdbheb>קָרוּעַ כֻּתָּנְתּוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:32\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,32)\">2Sam 15:32</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:121d»§ 121d</sup>); <bdbheb>שְׂמָתֹ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 37:34\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(1,37,34)\">Gen 37:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 44:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,44,13)\">Gen 44:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 7:6\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(6,7,6)\">Josh 7:6</ref> passive participle <bdbheb>מַדָּיו קְרֻעִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:12\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,12)\">1Sam 4:12</ref> (2) as symbolic act, <bdbheb>שַׂלְמָה שְׁנֵים עָשָׁר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>קְרָעִים ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:30\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,30)\">1Kgs 11:30</ref> (3) absolute <bdbheb>עֵת לִקְרוֺעַ וְעֵת לִתְפּוֺר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 3:7\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(21,3,7)\">Eccl 3:7</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>tear</highlight> away or out: veils <ref ref=\"Ezek 13:21\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(26,13,21)\">Ezek 13:21</ref>, fillets from (<bdbheb>מֵעַל</bdbheb>) arms v<ref ref=\"Ezek 13:20\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(26,13,20)\">Ezek 13:20</ref>, mark of leprosy out of (<bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb>) garment <ref ref=\"Lev 13:56\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"56\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"56\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,56)\">Lev 13:56</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>tear away</highlight> sovereignty (under figure of garment), subject <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מֵעַל</bdbheb> person <ref ref=\"1Sam 15:28\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(9,15,28)\">1Sam 15:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:11\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,11)\">1Kgs 11:11</ref>, also <bdbheb>מִיַּד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 28:17\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(9,28,17)\">1Sam 28:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:12\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,12)\">1Kgs 11:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:31\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,31)\">1Kgs 11:31</ref>, <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 14:8\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(11,14,8)\">1Kgs 14:8</ref>, absolute <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:13\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,13)\">1Kgs 11:13</ref> with accusative <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יִשׂ</bdbheb> + <bdbheb>מֵעַל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:21\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,21)\">2Kgs 17:21</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>tear, rend asunder:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> book with (<bdbheb>ב</bdbheb>) knife <ref ref=\"Jer 36:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,23)\">Jer 36:23</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> = <highlight>make wide, large</highlight>, eyes, with (<bdbheb>ב</bdbheb>) stibium <ref ref=\"Jer 4:30\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(24,4,30)\">Jer 4:30</ref> windows, <bdbheb>לוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וק</bdbheb> [<bdbheb>ו</bdbheb>]<bdbheb>חַלּוֺנָ֑י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 22:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,22,14)\">Jer 22:14</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <highlight>rend open</highlight> heavens, and descend of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Isa 63:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"63\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"63\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,63,19)\">Isa 63:19</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>tear, rend</highlight>, of wild beasts: <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> as fierce bear <ref ref=\"Hos 13:8\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(28,13,8)\">Hos 13:8</ref> (object <bdbheb>סְגוֺר לִבָּם</bdbheb>); figurative of human foes <ref ref=\"Ps 35:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,15)\">Ps 35:15</ref> (accusative of person omitted), so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hup')\">Hup</lookup> and others, but (from context) <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ol')\">Ol</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bae')\">Bae</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> and others <highlight>malign, rail</highlight> (compare Arabic above); &gt; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gr')\">Gr</lookup> and others <bdbheb>קָרְאוֺ</bdbheb>. <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>be rent</highlight>, of garment (<bdbheb>מְעִיל</bdbheb>), <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>וַיִּקָּרַ֑ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 15:27\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(9,15,27)\">1Sam 15:27</ref>, <bdbheb>יִקָּרֵעַ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 28:32\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,32)\">Exod 28:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 39:23\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(2,39,23)\">Exod 39:23</ref> <highlight>be rent, split asunder</highlight>, of altar <ref ref=\"1Kgs 13:3\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(11,13,3)\">1Kgs 13:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 13:5\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(11,13,5)\">1Kgs 13:5</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "1Sam 15:28", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 15, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Gen 37:29", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 37, "ve